cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ADMI: Airline Distortion and Market Index"
abstract: >-
  A quantitative index separating the portion of an airfare explained by
  distance from the portion explained by the absence of a competing carrier,
  applied to 49 Atlanta-origin routes across five departure dates and to
  domestic routes from Bengaluru as a comparison market.
message: "If you use this dataset or index, please cite it."
type: dataset
